# The Rain Engine's seeding vat with a mixer's suit (CIPlay the_rain_engine_acidsuit, 11-13 w11; a fresh test world
# 'CI ...'). The suit box reseedsuits on the rim gives 180 s of suit; into the vat, open the mixers' locker, out unhurt.
island The Rain Engine keep
hour 11
weather Calm
at 24 -62.5 h=13
use reseedsuits
expect shown reseedvat
walk 24 -62.5 to 21.5 -61.5 to 19.6 -60.8
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Mixers' locker
wait 2
expect item Battery 2
picture re_vat_in 22.5 14 -63.5 18 11 -60 light=20
walk 19.6 -60.8 to 22 -61.5 to 25 -62
expect unhurt
